  m_text: 'Welcome to the world of fun and gambling with the Pino Carnival app! Immerse
    yourself in the exciting atmosphere of the carnival, where bright emotions and
    unforgettable impressions await you.

    What awaits you:

    Unique games:
    Try your luck in the exciting game Plinko! Throw balls and watch them fall along
    colorful paths, collecting prizes and bonuses.

    Daily promotions and bonuses
    for VIP and exclusive clients: Don''t miss your chance to participate in special
    promotions and receive additional prizes!

    Easy access: The user-friendly
    interface of the application will allow you to quickly and easily purchase a
    ticket

    Join Pino Carnival and discover the world of fun, gambling and unforgettable
    moments! Buy tickets now and get ready for an unforgettable adventure!'
